    <string name="settings_continue_scope_description">All: the VR and the flat games started most recently. Shown tab: only those of the tab selected, VR or Flat.</string>
    <string name="settings_playtime">Count play time on Steam</string>
    <string name="settings_playtime_description">While a game is on screen, Steam is told the account is playing it, so its time counts on the account. Steam allows one game at a time: starting a game here interrupts one running on another device. Time while the device is asleep or the game is not on screen is not counted.</string>
